#: ui/k_mnu.cpp:453
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You have chosen to open another desktop session."
"<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen will be "
"displayed."
"<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually assigned to the "
"first session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can switch between "
"sessions by pressing Ctrl, Alt and the appropriate F-key at the same time. "
"Additionally, the KDE Panel and Desktop menus have actions for switching "
"between sessions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du wullt noch een annern Schrievdischtörn opmaken. "
"<br> De aktuelle Törn warrt verstekt un een niegen Anmell-Schirm wiest. "
"<br>För elkeen Törn gifft dat een Funktschoons-Tast, F%1 vör'n eersten, "
"F%2 vör'n tweeten usw. Du kannst twischen de Törns mit  Strg+Alt un de "
"richtigen F-Tast wesseln.</p>"

